# Cached public reference data (STRING, Reactome, ClinVar). Whole public releases,
# downloaded once and matched against locally -- not patient data, not in custody.
# The ClinVar release here is a .vcf.gz, which the patterns above already exclude; this
# entry keeps the whole cache out regardless of what a later layer adds to it.
reference/

# Claude Code machine-local settings (permission rules, per-machine state).
# .claude/settings.json is shareable and stays tracked if it is ever added;
# this file is not, and must not reach a public repository.
.claude/settings.local.json
